1
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:10,960
A month ago,

2
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:12,920
I was still working at a nightclub.

3
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,039
Someone came to me

4
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,900
and offered me a large sum of money

5
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,080
to impersonate someone.

6
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,280
My dad was seriously ill

7
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,680
and in the ICU at the time.

8
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,800
I really needed the money,

9
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,640
so I agreed.

10
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,720
So

11
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,200
the paternity test was also forged?

12
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:42,920
Yes.

13
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,000
Mrs. He said

14
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,920
she had made all the preparations,

15
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:48,780
and I just needed to focus on
pretending to be He Mei.

16
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:51,720
So Zhang Xin was the one
who found this substitute.

17
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,920
No wonder she was acting so strange.

18
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,520
Why would Mrs. He do this?

19
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,920
I don't know either.

20
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:57,400
I

21
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,880
really don't know.

22
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,120
I'm begging you,

23
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,120
please let me go.

24
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,960
I really only did it for the money.

25
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,000
Get up.

26
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,920
I'll pay you double

27
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,620
whatever Mrs. He gave you.

28
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,040
But tomorrow morning,

29
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,800
you must come with me to Mr. He

30
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,660
and explain everything clearly.

31
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,840
Okay.

32
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,280
That's great.

33
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:43,050
The paternity test results
just arrived too.

34
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,240
Bad news.

35
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:51,840
What's wrong?

36
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,200
The master just collapsed.

37
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,560
He's already been put in an ambulance.

38
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,290
Mrs. He and He Shi went with him.

39
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:12,240
Second Young Master,

40
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,200
please don't worry.

41
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,840
The master is out of danger.

42
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,520
But

43
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,680
he still needs to be observed for a while.

44
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:19,000
His condition is very unstable right now.

45
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:19,680
Okay.

46
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:49,960
What should I do now?

47
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:53,040
Should I keep pretending to be He Mei?

48
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:58,010
I have something more important
for you to do.

49
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,040
What's wrong?

50
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:14,960
Look.

51
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,280
It must be a prank.

52
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:25,880
Besides,

53
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,360
isn't He Mei dead?

54
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,200
What are you doing?

55
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,000
You scared me.

56
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,120
Okay, you guys talk.

57
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,520
Mrs. He,

58
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,720
my dad happens to be in this hospital too.

59
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,400
Can I go see him?

60
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,400
No.

61
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,960
Remember,

62
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,159
you are He Mei.

63
00:04:51,159 --> 00:04:52,620
Your only father is Mr. He.

64
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,680
What if

65
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,040
the real He Mei comes back?

66
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,440
She's never coming back.

67
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,680
You are He Mei.

68
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,930
If she's never coming back,

69
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,380
why do you want me to pretend to be her?

70
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:08,100
That's none of your business.

71
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,460
That's exactly what she just told me.

72
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:17,960
I see.

73
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,080
Thank you for helping me test Mrs. He.

74
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:20,920
You can go now.

75
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,440
It seems Zhang Xin

76
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:30,320
really believes I'm dead.

77
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,860
I bought you some food.

78
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,300
I'm not hungry.

79
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:18,160
Seeing you care so much about my dad,

80
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,720
I'm a bit suspicious.

81
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,380
Let me show you something.

82
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:45,810
Why is your hair different
from everyone else's?

83
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,700
Otherwise, it'd be so boring.

84
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,640
I can take the punishment,

85
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:52,040
but I also have the right
not to admit fault.

86
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,680
You're allergic to mangoes.

87
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,680
Why did you still eat them?

88
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,409
Because I wanted to prove to you

89
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,000
that He Mei is a fake.

90
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,560
No wonder I had a feeling.

91
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,920
You really are He Mei.

92
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,800
Years ago,

93
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,120
I accidentally caught Zhang Xin

94
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,560
trying to kill Mom.

95
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:33,210
So she simply set the place on fire.

96
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:36,080
When she found out I survived,

97
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:38,180
she ordered the butler to kill me.

98
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,370
The butler didn't dare to do it.

99
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:45,180
He sold me to human traffickers instead.

100
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,380
No wonder we couldn't find you back then,

101
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:07,060
even after calling the police

102
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,220
and posting missing person notices.

103
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,280
How have you been

104
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:29,880
all these years?

105
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,080
I'm sorry, Mei.

106
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,200
I should have recognized you

107
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,799
the first time I saw you.

108
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:41,960
I don't blame you,

109
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,919
brother.

110
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:47,040
You've already done so much for me.

111
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,640
Then why didn't you tell me

112
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,290
when I asked you before?

113
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,920
I didn't dare to make a move

114
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:05,720
without solid evidence.

115
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,920
You know

116
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:09,040
He Shi and Zhang Xin
call the shots in this house.

117
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,720
If I took one wrong step,

118
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:13,200
they'd kick me out of the He family.

119
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,000
I couldn't take that risk.

120
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,120
I won't lose you again

121
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,680
this time.

122
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:59,800
We haven't had enough to drink yet.

123
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,600
Why did you run off?

124
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:02,600
I just came out

125
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,240
for some fresh air.

126
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:08,920
What's the matter?

127
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,490
The old man runs into this all the time.

128
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,100
They must be scammers.

129
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,440
Come on.

130
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:26,280
I feel like it's different this time.

131
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,760
It seems real.

132
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:33,880
The old man is finally away tonight.

133
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,280
Can't you just enjoy

134
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,040
our time together?

135
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:39,560
No, no.

136
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:41,320
I have to find the will.

137
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,360
Where on earth is the will?

138
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,800
Where on earth is the will?
